0..100 Comment "/// A record whose last field is a record sharing a label with it prints, and reprints, as a record."
101..104 Comment "///"
105..223 Comment "/// The inner record\'s key binds its own field, so the outer record\'s label stays unread and its fields stay a record."
224..227 Comment "///"
228..336 Comment "/// Each record type here is read back from its printed spelling, and the reading prints as the same record."
337..340 Comment "///"
341..400 Comment "/// - see: #3010 — the reading printed again as a product"
